  "descriptionHtml": "<div class='product-description'>'<p>Elevate your cold-weather adventures and conquer wet trails with the Nike Vomero Roam. Constructed with a textile and suede upper, these shoes feature a water-repellent finish that keeps your feet fresh, dry, and comfortable all day. The easy-to-adjust lace toggles with a hook offer a customized fit, while the Nike Air Zoom units provide responsive cushioning and energy return. Boasting a High Abrasion Rubber Tech (HART) outsole, these lightweight silhouettes use less rubber compound than other XDR technologies, enhancing durability and abrasion resistance. Unlock your potential and navigate your journey in true Nike style with the Nike Vomero Roam.</p> <p><strong>Nike Vomero Roam features:</strong></p> <ul> <li>Reflective details enable low-light visibility.</li> <li>Chunky foam midsole gives a visible boost of comfort and style.</li> <li>Rubber mudguard maximizes protection from dirt and puddles.</li> <li>Rubber outsole offers durable traction.</li> </ul> <p>*Not intended for use as Personal Protective Equipment (PPE).</p><hr /><p>Cold, wet days call for comfort, grip, and coverage without switching to a full boot. Built for everyday wear in unpredictable weather, the Nike Vomero Roam brings the cushioned feel of the Vomero line into a rugged, winter-ready design that stays comfortable from commutes to long walks.</p><ul><li>Textile and suede upper with a water-repellent finish</li><li>Easy-to-adjust toggle lacing with a hook for quick fit changes</li><li>Nike Air Zoom units and a chunky foam midsole for cushioned comfort</li><li>Rubber mudguard helps block out dirt and puddles</li><li>Reflective details add visibility in low light</li><li>High Abrasion Rubber Tech outsole helps deliver durable traction</li></ul>  <p><strong>Size &amp; Fit Guidance</strong></p> <p>Most reviewers found the fit true to size. For the best fit, we recommend your usual size for standard wear, or a half size up if you prefer extra toe room, have wider feet, or plan to wear thicker socks in colder weather.</p>  <p><strong>Best For</strong></p> <p>Best for cold commutes, rainy-day errands, travel, and everyday walking when you want sneaker comfort with added weather protection.</p>  <p><strong>Styling &amp; Versatility</strong></p> <p>This design blends runner comfort with winter-shoe utility, giving it a bold, rugged look that stands out in daily rotation. Reviewers especially like how easily it moves between casual wear, outdoor walks, and messy weather without feeling like a traditional boot.</p>  <p><strong>Break-In &amp; Durability</strong></p> <p>Comfort is a highlight from the start for many wearers, while some note the more structured collar and upper benefit from a short break-in to fully settle in. Once dialed in, the build is widely praised for its sturdy feel and dependable performance in rain, slush, and cold conditions.</p>  <p><strong>Care &amp; Maintenance</strong></p> <p>Wipe the mudguard and upper clean after mud, slush, or puddles, then let the shoes air dry. Reviewers also note the winterized materials are easy to keep looking fresh for regular cold-weather wear.</p>\"</div>\n\n<div class=\"product-specifications\" style=\"margin: 20px 0;\">\n  <h3 style=\"font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Specifications</h3>\n  <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;\">\n    <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Brand</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Model</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Nike Vomero Roam - Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Gender</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Men's</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Color</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Black/Black/Black</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Width</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Width - D - Medium</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Material</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Breathable mesh upper with durable synthetic overlays and rubber traction outsole</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Manufacturer SKU</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>FV2295-002</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;font-weight:600;'>Category</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;'>Shoes</td></tr></tbody>\n  </table>\n</div>\n\n\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin: 20px 0; padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e0e0e0; border-radius: 6px;\">\n  <summary style=\"font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; font-size: 15px;\">Nike Size Guide &amp; Conversions (Men's)</summary>\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 12px;\">\n    <p style=\"font-size: 13px; color: #666; margin-bottom: 8px;\">Official Nike shoe size conversion matrix (US / UK / EU):</p>\n    <table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 13px;\">\n      <thead>\n        <tr style=\"background-color: #f5f5f5;\">\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">US Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">UK Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">EU Size</th>\n          <th style=\"padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;\">Availability</th>\n        </tr>\n      </thead>\n      <tbody><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 7.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 6.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 40.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 7</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>EU 41</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>Out of Stock</td></tr><tr><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>US 8.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;text-align:center;'>UK 7.5</td><td style='padding:6px 12px;te